<code>assert this.size() > 0 => \forall int i; 0 <= i && i < this.size(); this.comparator().compare(this.peek(), this.get(i)) <= 0;</code>

This assert statement checks that if the queue is not empty, the element returned by `peek()` is less than or equal to every other element in the queue according to the comparator. If no comparator is provided, the natural ordering of the elements is used.
--------------------
